lient_msg_id":"8bc6d761-3b69-48e0-8b29-67f76a0b3d86","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"デフォルトの設定はココ見ると良いです。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/terminal/blob/main/src/cascadia/TerminalSettingsModel/defaults.json\u003e","ts":"1617603245.199200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: microsoft/terminal","id":1,"title":"microsoft/terminal","title_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/blob/main/src/cascadia/TerminalSettingsModel/defaults.json","text":"The new Windows Terminal and the original Windows console host, all in the same place! - microsoft/terminal","thumb_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/100060912/dc77b180-764a-11e9-9e12-aace7d0ecd7d","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":500,"thumb_height":250,"from_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/blob/main/src/cascadia/TerminalSettingsModel/defaults.json","original_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/terminal/blob/main/src/cascadia/TerminalSettingsModel/defaults.json"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8/7As"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9e4b862-b392-463b-9a07-4d8b50b1c740","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そんなマッピングもあるのか… settings.json にはなかったから…","ts":"1617603176.198900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fa5na"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fba4878f-aa13-4e7b-b88d-52aa215d0de7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぼくはだいたいデフォルトのCtrl+Shift+V使っちゃう。","ts":"1617603097.198500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TX9TP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"147829e4-9782-49e6-9159-1ca71c828216","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"直りました…最初はまだセットアップしてなかった AutoHotkey を入れたからでした\nAutoHotkey でも端末系アプリ上でだけ `Alt+v` を `Shift+Insert` に変換する設定をしていたんですが、これ以前からうまく動いていなかったんですよね。Windows Terminal だと自前でいけるので設定消しました","ts":"1617603081.198300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bIchj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b678fec-6afa-44d6-be56-3a3ca9af85b9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとCtrl+Shift+Pでコマンドパレットでるんで、そこで「貼り付け」って入れると割り当たってるキーが出てくるけど、複数ある場合はドレがでてくるかまでは調べたことないんですよね。","ts":"1617603075.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tFQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc4ff94f-2a80-48cc-9c74-5424045bd61f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうそう","ts":"1617603031.196300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8/=mc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6804f90-02eb-465d-b5aa-03f3e6137fc2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別のプログラムというのは Windows 上でグローバルに動いているやつですかね? あ、心当たりあるかもしれない…","ts":"1617602923.195400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qQDd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5971dc4d-75c0-45b8-ae0c-da6b69928d30","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コマンドパレット出すと何が割り当てられているかは確認できたりするけど、複数設定されている場合はちょっとどうなるかわかんないしなぁ…","ts":"1617602866.194800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aLa9j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"544d6242-4aeb-4b8f-8e81-fe3ff989f7b2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んー別のプログラムで設定しているショートカットに食われてる、とかかなぁ…","ts":"1617602833.194100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BXvoE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e943b529-c5f7-4eab-a472-bcbb16d36035","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Windows Terminal で Alt+v で paste できるように actions に `{ \"command\": \"paste\", \"keys\": \"alt+v\" },` を足したのだけど、足した直後はうまく動いていた気がしたのだけど今は動かなくなってしまった…なんでだろう…","ts":"1617601279.193300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fi/"}]}]
